# Transaction Monitoring & Alerts Dashboard

## What this is
A REST API + dashboard that records transactions, evaluates them against
configurable rules, and manages alerts through a lifecycle
(OPEN → ACKNOWLEDGED → INVESTIGATING → CLOSED / DISMISSED).

Stack: Java + Spring Boot (backend), React (frontend), single relational
database. No authentication — single operator assumed.

## Before you do anything
Read `Project_milestones.md` at the repo root before starting or resuming
